	NascentTeleport: Void Step
	NascentTeleportDescription: Teleport to the cursor or map; 20 Qi + 2 per 2 blocks
	FlameStep: Flame Step
	FlameStepDescription: Directional fiery dash that damages and breaks terrain
	Fireball: Fireball
	FireballDescription: Explosive projectile; cost and size scale with damage
