DebugCommands: {
	MultiplayerDisabled: Debug commands are disabled in multiplayer. Enable them explicitly in the server configuration for a private test session
	HelpTitle: Xianxia debug commands (Realm numbers: 1-5)
	Help1: /xiadebug status - show current test state
	Help2: /xiadebug set <realm> <stage> - jump to a Realm and Stage
	Help3: /xiadebug qi <amount|fill|empty> - change usable Qi
	Help4: /xiadebug advance - trigger the next normal breakthrough
	Help5: /xiadebug tribulation <core|nascent> - prepare a Tribulation confirmation
	Help6: /xiadebug tribulation <win|fail> - resolve the current Tribulation instantly
	Help7: /xiadebug ability <name|all> <1-20> - set technique level
	Help8: /xiadebug effect <stage|realm> | /xiadebug reset
	Help9: /xiadebug beast <hare|deer|fox|tiger> - spawn a Spirit Beast
	Help10: /xiadebug spawncheck - explain which Spirit Beasts can spawn here
	Help11: /xiadebug alchemy <tier 0-4> <low|middle|high> | alchemy saturation <0-100>
	Unknown: Unknown debug action: {0}
	SetUsage: Usage: /xiadebug set <realm 1-5|name> <stage 1-9>
	QiUsage: Usage: /xiadebug qi <amount|fill|empty>
	TribulationUsage: Usage: /xiadebug tribulation <core|nascent|win|fail>
	AbilityUsage: Usage: /xiadebug ability <ability name|all> <level 1-20>
	EffectUsage: Usage: /xiadebug effect <stage|realm>
	BeastUsage: Usage: /xiadebug beast <hare|deer|fox|tiger>
	BeastSinglePlayer: Spirit Beast spawning is available only in single-player
	BeastSpawned: Spawned: {0}
	AlchemyUsage: Usage: /xiadebug alchemy <tier 0-4> <low|middle|high> | /xiadebug alchemy saturation <0-100>
	AlchemyRankSet: Alchemy debug rank set to Tier {0} - {1}, {2} Stage
	AlchemySaturationSet: Pill Saturation set to {0}/100
	SpawnCheckTitle: === Spirit Beast spawn check ===
	SpawnCheckEnvironment: Biome: {0} | {1} | {2} blocks from world spawn | {3}, Stage {4}
	SpawnCheckSettings: Enabled: {0} | Distance scaling: {1} | Rate: {2}% | Safe zone: {3} | Invasion: {4}
	SpawnCheckEligible: "[CAN SPAWN] {0}"
	SpawnCheckBlocked: "[BLOCKED] {0}: {1}"
	SpawnCheckReasonDisabled: Spirit Beasts are disabled in the server configuration
	SpawnCheckReasonSafe: town NPCs or a Peace Candle make this a safe zone
	SpawnCheckReasonInvasion: an invasion is active
	SpawnCheckReasonRealm: requires player Realm: {0}
	SpawnCheckReasonDistance: move at least {0} more blocks from world spawn (minimum {1})
	SpawnCheckReasonHabitat: biome, depth or time requirement is not met
	SpawnCheckCandidateNote: Natural spawning also requires Terraria to choose a dry land tile outside a safe area and to have room under the NPC cap.
